abstract: "Replication and extension of Cederburg, O'Doherty, Wang and Yan (2025). The paper rebuilds a 1926-2025 panel of international asset returns (stocks, sovereign bonds, bills, gold and a managed-futures trend-following proxy), re-estimates the levered lifecycle portfolios of the original study, and extends them to a four-sleeve design."
